--- Normal upper and lower ---
upper('hello world'): HELLO WORLD
lower('HELLO WORLD'): hello world
upper('Mixed Case 123!'): MIXED CASE 123!
lower('Mixed Case 123!'): mixed case 123!
--- Empty string ---
upper(''):
lower(''):
--- Non-string / nil arguments ---
upper(nil) == nil: true
lower(nil) == nil: true
upper(123) == nil: true
lower(true) == nil: true
